<title>CYPRUS: Earthquake shakes Cyprus capital.</title>
<headline>Earthquake shakes Cyprus capital.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>An earthquake shook the Cyprus capital of Nicosia on Monday.</p>
<p>The tremor, which lasted about 30 seconds, shook buildings and was also felt in the nearby town of Larnaca, witnesses said. There were no immediate reports of casualties or damage.</p>
